 retrospective videos from the original team. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Updated Combat, UI &amp; Customisation</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upgraded hardware interface makes the original titles more accessible without losing the soul of the original gameplay. Precision controls as standard, with full twin-stick support for both 2D and 3D titles, and classic Mouse and Keyboard support for 3D. Drastically improved framerates provide a fluid FPS experience. Tactical Save States provide multiple slots to pause and continue different runs. Fine-tune your visuals, audio and gameplay settings across the entire collection with the Global Customisation options.<strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/extras/f2c5e39127b7b0cd97cdf1d4ee6efce1.poster.avif?t=1788287122\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/extras/f2c5e39127b7b0cd97cdf1d4ee6efce1.webm?t=1788287122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/extras/f2c5e39127b7b0cd97cdf1d4ee6efce1.mp4?t=1788287122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Retro-Visual Suite</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between a classic 4:3 aspect ratio or modern 16:9 formats. Capture the authentic 90s glow with the CRT Experience offering professional-grade Scanlines, CRT TV, and &quot;Mega CRT&quot; filters. Toggle custom in-game screen bezels to perfectly frame the retro action on modern monitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/extras/c5b1eef03f5cfefdad9297f1a8894ff2.poster.avif?t=1788287122\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/extras/c5b1eef03f5cfefdad9297f1a8894ff2.webm?t=1788287122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/extras/c5b1eef03f5cfefdad9297f1a8894ff2.mp4?t=1788287122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer &amp; New Challenges</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Co-Op modes have been preserved exactly as players remember from the originals for those seeking a traditional trip down memory lane. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Rush Mode &amp; Horde Mode – Take on a high-stakes P2P Online Co-Op experience in Rush Mode. Tackle the relentless swarm in solo or as a team across all supported platforms with no saves and no continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the all-new Horde Mode solo survival experience. See how long you can last against the hunger of the Breed.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "THE BREED IS BACK! Celebrate 35 years of Alien Breed with the definitive collection. Featuring 6 classic games, interactive archives, modern controls, visual enhancements, co-op multiplayer, Online Rush Mode and Horde Mode, bringing the complete sci-fi horror legacy back to your screens.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/03a8113754074a9e82b9a05caf5de5e6d73bfe8c/header.jpg?t=1788287122", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870460/af5c9f30e3c41ba4098c563b038595a94ff8c076/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788287122", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a